# Your rule content

The firebase database structure for this app is the following:

activities
    classId
    className
    teacherName
    timestamp
    type
    userId

classes
    code
    createdAt
    name
    quizzes
        id
        title
    studentCount
    students
        (id of student is the value of the index)
    teacherId
    updatedAt

enrollments
    classId
    enrolledAt
    status
    studentId

quizAttempts
    answers
        array in answers includes the answer given as a number
    classId
    correctAnswers
    questionCount
    questionResults
        correctIndex
        isCorrect
        questionIndex
        questionText
        selectedOption
            text
        userAnswer

quizzes
    createdAt
    id
    questions
        correctIndex
            options
                text
        text

users 
    bio
    classes
        array in classes includes ids of classes associated to this user
    createdAt
    email
    lastLogin
    name
    phone
    role (student or teacher)
    updatedAt